{"title":"Career Roadmap: Energy / Renewable Energy Engineering → Renewable Project Engineer","role":"Renewable Project Engineer","summary":"A Renewable Project Engineer supports the engineering, planning, procurement, construction, commissioning and performance management of renewable-energy projects.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Energy / Renewable Energy Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Domain","text":"Renewable Energy Projects, Solar/Wind Systems, Project Execution & Energy Engineering"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Renewable Project Engineer supports the engineering, planning, procurement, construction, commissioning and performance management of renewable-energy projects."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the employer, the role can involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar PV projects"},{"text":"Wind-energy projects"},{"text":"Hybrid renewable systems"},{"text":"Battery energy storage"},{"text":"Rooftop solar"},{"text":"Utility-scale renewable projects"},{"text":"Microgrids"},{"text":"Energy-efficiency projects"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines engineering","project management","site execution","energy analysis."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Project Requirement","Site Assessment","Resource Assessment","System Design","Energy Yield Analysis","Cost / Feasibility Analysis","Engineering & Procurement","Construction","Installation","Testing & Commissioning","Performance Monitoring"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Role Direction","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Engineering Student"},{"text":"Energy and electrical/mechanical fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Intern"},{"text":"Solar/wind analysis and project support"}],[{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Renewable Projec